1                        I.       WITNESS IDENTIFICATION

2    Q.   Please state your name and business address.

3    A.   My name is Alexander G. Trowbridge. I am the Director of Regulatory Pricing and

 4        Analysis at Southwestern Public Service Company (“SPS”), a subsidiary of Xcel

 5        Energy Inc. (“Xcel Energy”). My business address is 3500 Blake Street, Denver,

 6        Colorado 80205.

 7   Q.   On whose behalf are you testifying in this proceeding?

 8   A.   I am filing testimony on behalf of SPS, a New Mexico corporation and wholly

 9        owned electric utility subsidiary of Xcel Energy.

10   Q.   Are you the same Alexander G. Trowbridge who filed direct testimony in this

11        proceeding on November 20, 2025?

12   A.   Yes.

13   Q.   Were the Attachments AGT-BR3-1 through AGT-BR3-8, including

14        workpapers “WP Present to Proposed Rates, FTY 2027”, which reflect

15        stipulation-specific information, prepared by you or under your supervision

16        and control?

17   A.   Yes.




                                               1
                                     Case No. 25-00079-UT
                                   Supplemental Testimony
                                              of
                                   Alexander G. Trowbridge

 1                           II.    THIRD BENCH REQUEST
 2   Q.   What is the purpose of this supplemental testimony?

 3   A.   The purpose of my supplemental testimony is to respond to the following Third

 4        Bench Request issued by the New Mexico Public Regulation Commission

 5        (“Commission”):

 6                      “SPS shall provide updated and executable versions of the following
 7                      Rule 530 Schedules:”

 8                      •   “Schedule A-2: Summary of the Revenue Increase or Decrease
 9                          at the Proposed Rate by Rate Classes”
10                      “Additionally, in direct testimony, SPS witness Alexander G.
11                      Trowbridge provided Attachments AGT-2, AGT-3, AGT-4, AGT-5,
12                      AGT-6, AGT-8, and AGT-9, and workpaper “WP Present to
13                      Proposed Rates, FTY 2027. SPS shall provide updated and
14                      executable versions of these Attachments and workpaper “WP
15                      Present to Proposed Rates, FTY 2027,” that reflect stipulation-
16                      specific information.”
17   Q.   Are you providing any updated attachments as part of your testimony?

18   A.   Yes. In response to the Commission's Third Bench Request, I have updated the

19        original filing package to reflect stipulation-specific information. The updates

20        include revisions to Schedule A-2; Attachments AGT-2, AGT-3, AGT-4, AGT-5,

21        AGT-6, AGT-8, and AGT-9; and the supporting workpapers, including ‘WP

22        Present to Proposed Rates, FTY 2027’.



